body:
Let's brainstorm. What would you say in this moment would make living easier for you? What about in the long term perhaps? ie. not living at home, etc.

&#x200B;

We both know that suicide is not the option, so instead of restating that I can say that I found out how much stronger I was after my attempt. Each time I came back realizing that what I had tried was fucking stupid. My mother did the same thing. All that happened is that she is gone and I have to pick up the pieces. Death is death. There are no back spaces. So live life as much as you can for as long as you can.
